cient tonalpohualli rune reading into something deeply personal, interactive, and alive. Whether you draw 3 or 5 runes, each session becomes a unique journey guiding you through symbols that have carried meaning for centuries and translating them into insights tailored to your present moment.", "short_description": "Aztec Rune Meditation is an extended reality app that lets you perform rune with tonalpohualli readings with 3 or 5 runes. It describes each rune you draw and analyzes them together to provide a more accurate and personalized reading in every session."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://intusxr.github.io/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IntusXR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://intusxr.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26683845794605884"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293844_1089926284205204_6345404245116153735_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qd328bttiKsQ7kNvwGcHhJ_&_nc_oc=Ado6kw7QoUS0k6gJ327JVlPPJ2WVDOtbsAOWYFAgi3wDw_2yrxMzZ0HpdXItTcS1TLY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRo0yzM1TdFuHxsPTBySax5tOXp1coj2W1bVullHTIVSg&oe=6AFB4297"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_t